  "question": {
    "text": "The relation between time ‘<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>’ and distance ‘<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>’ is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi></math> are constants. The relation between acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math> and velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced></math> is:",
